ge before the credits. Word on the road about the Elite Four: the Elite Four open with an ice-and-water lady — folks say lightning and grass are how you slip past her; and then the dragon master himself — and everyone says the same thing: ice is the only thing a dragon truly fears. YOUR STORY SO FAR (what you\'ve actually done — your past, not the future): All eight Gym Badges are yours. The Elite Four and the Champion are the summit.. Next on my list: catch an growlithe around Route 7 / Route 8. It grows into my arcanine — that\'s my answer for Champion down the line. Grabbing it now, before I need it.. THINGS YOU\'VE HEARD AND READ (from people and signs — your own notes, use them when they point somewhere): "I had a vision of your arrival. I have had psychic powers since I was a child. It started when a spoon I carelessly tossed, bent. I dislike battling, but if you"; "Sealed within that TM06 lies TOXIC! It is a secret technique dating back some four hundred years."; "KIRA put the TM06 in the TM CASE."; "KIRA received TM06 from KOGA.". YOUR PLAN — right now: You\'re ready — stop grinding and push forward to the next objective. Next: FIRST HM Fly — a girl in the hidden house on Route 16, just west of Celadon behind a cuttable tree, teaches your team to fly you between towns — the gym comes right after; that errand is the road. Bigger picture: Take on the Elite Four. Your team right now: blastoise (L61), rattata (L19), abra the kadabra (L19), diglett (L18), lapras (L25), pidgey (L3). Remember YOU are the one playing this — narrate your plan to chat in your own voice (first person: "I\'m grinding", "my team"), and never ask anyone what you\'re doing or who\'s on your team — you know.. HEADS UP — you just chose \'head_to_league\' and NOTHING changed (same spot, no progress). Repeating it again will do the same nothing. Pick a DIFFERENT action this time and break the loop.', 'progress': '8 badge(s) earned (Boulder, Cascade, Thunder, Rainbow, Soul, Marsh, Volcano, Eart